: "Seventeen-story is a compound modifier; story stays singular before building.", "options": ["They adopted a three-year-old-dog from the shelter.", "She finished a five-week long internship.", "We rented a seventeen-story building.", "He bought a two-dollars-coffee."], "correct_answer": "We rented a seventeen-story building."}, "reason": "EXPLANATION_OR_ACCESSIBILITY_CLEANUP"}, {"n": 522, "original_id": "f4acdc6b-a0fd-41ee-9f6c-1fcfc4eee593", "original_hash": "a39efa737f3496c87ffee9bbc68223582ddd4110d209789603381e465053937f", "replacement_id": "250bdb66-19ba-520a-9410-24af7a3fc12b", "patch": {"explanation": "Clear-cut describes an unambiguous, clearly defined update.", "options": ["well-thinking", "clear-cut", "strong-build", "high-opinioned"], "correct_answer": "clear-cut"}, "reason": "EXPLANATION_OR_ACCESSIBILITY_CLEANUP"}, {"n": 523, "original_id": "f7f539d5-cd04-4f02-afea-d10a46f0f2b0", "original_hash": "56ab21fd711b74b6caa6254f1ae81f8162e6e45dc0c3dc63649f65d330d83a6b", "replacement_id": "40b3cf1d-195e-5ce7-847f-a9e3ae1f2a84", "patch": {"question_text": "Which compound adjective describes an approach guided by logical reasoning?", "correct_answer": "logic-driven", "explanation": "Logic-driven means guided by logic. High-minded refers to moral principles rather than logical reasoning.", "options": ["high-minded", "good-behaving", "soft-talking", "logic-driven"]}, "reason": "SEMANTICALLY_ARBITRARY_KEY"}, {"n": 525, "original_id": "0c3bfeb2-f2ab-4118-8abd-5ab951d08295", "original_hash": "7a6f8bb06b4ebb7eee4df66a52de8c6128abc7296b642b616b8f0de789021d5f", "replacement_id": "e8befd82-574e-5eb6-8847-b96abf95c9bc", "patch": {"question_text": "Choose the time conjunction meaning “during the whole time that an ongoing action happens”. Choose the best conjunction: I was watching TV ____ my brother cooked dinner.", "explanation": "while expresses during the whole time that an ongoing action happens. The other choices express cause, condition or contrast.", "options": ["be