 stated final action.", "options": ["Then", "Finally", "Because", "But"], "correct_answer": "Then"}, "reason": "SEQUENCE_CONNECTOR_ALTERNATIVE"}, {"n": 1515, "original_id": "b29a9b4a-7be5-b879-0225-e51d591561b0", "original_hash": "210ec437455035c41779b04e900e9780f7b716af2be496665c7149b59681323e", "replacement_id": "37729beb-8c3f-5644-a3a2-50d1f8a95cf1", "patch": {"question_text": "First log in. _____ choose your class from the menu. Finally, open your assignment.", "explanation": "Then marks the middle step; finally introduces the last step.", "options": ["Then", "Finally", "Because", "But"], "correct_answer": "Then"}, "reason": "SEQUENCE_CONNECTOR_ALTERNATIVE"}, {"n": 1530, "original_id": "566b323b-8bd3-bead-50f3-ff07efafcbe3", "original_hash": "e7b78ebf68c17e5a239d6d46def2450587a860ad850fe47a04b353d54be9458b", "replacement_id": "bdf0d05e-287b-5aa6-b1fb-9e5261df4e7e", "patch": {"question_text": "The owner is one person or animal, not a group. That is _____ jacket.", "explanation": "One owner takes apostrophe + s. A plural owner ending in s takes an apostrophe after that s, which is not the meaning requested here.", "options": ["the boy's", "the boys", "the boy", "the boys'"], "correct_answer": "the boy's"}, "reason": "OWNER_NUMBER_UNSPECIFIED"}, {"n": 1531, "original_id": "640f1d62-efda-e276-b91a-2a6e6e228c4e", "original_hash": "441fa17d81455fdf0d1f0f93ebfb28ccca22a7ae99ac880cab3dc6d7cd2f78d5", "replacement_id": "9280df2d-ab74-5e9d-b8d1-db3ca61595ab", "patch": {"question_text": "The owner is one person or animal, not a group. The water is in _____ bowl.", "explanation": "One owner takes apostrophe + s. A plural owner ending in s takes an apostrophe after that s, which is not the meaning requested here.", "options": ["the dog's", "the dogs", "the dog", "the dogs'"], "correct_answer": "the dog's"}, "reason": "OWNER_NUMBER_UNSPECIFIED"}, {"n": 1534, "original_id": "9b1cca80-a6e0-4fac-93ee-2c1f5d4cefb1", "original_hash": "3f1ce807965b1137ca846fc59aa0440668d6b10f335d197